        <description>Tracks where design will go to production to help track where revenue will be produced</description>
        <inlineHelpText>Indicate the region where the design will be manufactured.  Although optional, this is a reportable field and will help identify where to expect the revenue.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Manufacturing Region</label>
