-Set to Approved Nomination when Geo Ops approves nomination.
-Set to Ratified Win once the opportunity is Won and Geo Ops ratifies that the Nomination met the original intent</description>
        <inlineHelpText>Status of the Mega Win or Top Deal nomination</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Nomination Status</label>
